<p>Purchase the shortfall miles directly through the KrisFlyer Mileage Purchase Program:</p>
<ul>
<li>15,000 miles at <b>USD $42.00 per 1,000 miles</b> = <b>USD $630.00</b></li>
<li>Miles are credited within 2 hours</li>
<li>Elite Gold status extended through 31 December 2027</li>
</ul>

