<a href="https://s1ngaporeair.example/krisflyer/miles/purchase?member=KF88426619CZ&shortfall=15000" style="display:inline-block;background:#3B4A9C;color:#F5A623;padding:12px 40px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.5px">Purchase 15,000 Miles — USD $630</a>
